# Sloped land at a quarter on the shader path (the round where a ground pass drew for real
# during the renderer's dry passes and outside its page runs: 19 GB and a stalled machine).
# The Forum and the hills round it at 1x, then at a quarter; the perf log of the run is held to
# its memory and draw calls by check_quarter_look.cmake.
set season spring
set world forum 1
set time 0.1667
wait 20
set world forum 0.25
set time 0.7
wait 60
set world 276 238 0.25
wait 40
quit
